{"title": "Hide", "pageid": 3968, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hide", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Common actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hide.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Hide.webp/300px-Hide.webp, /w/images/f/fa/Hide.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Hide.webp/300px-Hide.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Hide.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Hide</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Action</a> that allows the user to conceal their location.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Try to conceal yourself.\n</p>\nHiding depends on your <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> and whether you are <a href=\"/wiki/Obscured\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Obscured\">Obscured</a>. Attacking or casting spells reveals your location.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Hide</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Hide\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=AllowMoveAndCast_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"AllowMoveAndCast (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">AllowMoveAndCast</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CombatLogSetSingleLineRoll_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CombatLogSetSingleLineRoll (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CombatLogSetSingleLineRoll</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=ImmediateCast_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ImmediateCast (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">ImmediateCast</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Invisible (spell flag)\">Invisible</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Stealth_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Stealth (spell flag)\">Stealth</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=UnavailableInDialogs_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"UnavailableInDialogs (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">UnavailableInDialogs</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Hiding\"> Condition: Hiding </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)\" title=\"Hiding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hiding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Hiding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hiding_(Condition)\" title=\"Hiding (Condition)\">Hiding</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity is invisible to enemies until it crosses their cone of sight.</li>\n<li>The entity has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on all <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Rolls</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If a player character is in the line of sight of a non-allied creature, and is either in melee range or considered to be in a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clear_Area_(Condition)\" title=\"Clear Area (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Clear Area\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clear_Area_(Condition)\" title=\"Clear Area (Condition)\">Clear Area</a> (see <a href=\"/wiki/Obscurity\" title=\"Obscurity\">obscurity</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Darkvision\" title=\"Darkvision\">darkvision</a>), then the character is spotted immediately.</li>\n<li>If they are in the line of sight of a non-allied creature while considered <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightly Obscured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\">Lightly Obscured</a> (with darkvision taken into account) and not in melee range, then the player character rolls a <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> check contesting a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_checks\" title=\"Passive checks\">passive Perception check</a> by the other creature. This is displayed as a <i>Hiding Check</i> in the combat log, whose <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">Difficulty Class</a> is determined by the passive Perception score of the other creature. It is repeated every turn (or every 6 seconds outside of turn-based mode) and for each non-allied creature that has line of sight on the hiding player character.</li>\n<li>The line of sight of creatures without darkvision does not extend into <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavily Obscured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Obscured (Condition)\">Heavily Obscured</a> areas, so they cannot detect a character hiding in such an area.</li>\n<li>Attacking automatically ends hiding, meaning that undetected <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth_attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stealth attack\">stealth attacks</a> cannot be made from within an enemies' line of sight, even if successfully hiding in obscurity prior to the attack. However, attacking from hiding is still beneficial, because it confers <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack roll</a>.</li>\n<li>Lines of sight (aka 'vision cones') are shown with a red overlay when the selected player character is currently in hiding. They can be manipulated using distractions such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minor_Illusion\" title=\"Minor Illusion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp/20px-Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp/30px-Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp/40px-Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minor Illusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp/20px-Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Minor_Illusion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Minor_Illusion\" title=\"Minor Illusion\">Minor Illusion</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Meow\" title=\"Meow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Meow_Icon.webp/20px-Meow_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Meow_Icon.webp/30px-Meow_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Meow_Icon.webp/40px-Meow_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Meow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Meow_Icon.webp/20px-Meow_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Meow_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Meow\" title=\"Meow\">Meow</a>, which compel creatures to turn towards a specific direction and / or walk to another location. This can create an opening for a <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_hand\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sleight of hand\">pickpocketing</a> attempt or a stealth attack.</li>\n<li>Hiding inside a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fog_Cloud\" title=\"Fog Cloud\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp/40px-Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fog Cloud\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp/20px-Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Fog_Cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fog_Cloud\" title=\"Fog Cloud\">Fog Cloud</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/20px-Darkness_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/30px-Darkness_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/40px-Darkness_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/20px-Darkness_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\">Darkness</a> is an automatic success as sight cones of enemies do not reach inside unless they have a passive that grants sight through magical darkness like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Sight\" title=\"Devil's Sight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/20px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/30px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/40px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devil's Sight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/20px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Sight\" title=\"Devil's Sight\">Devil's Sight</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Born_into_Darkness\" title=\"Born into Darkness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/20px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/30px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/40px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Born into Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/20px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Born_into_Darkness\" title=\"Born into Darkness\">Born into Darkness</a>. This also makes up for the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blind\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blind</a> debuff, as enemies cannot target the player character from outside the cloud if they are hiding.</li>\n<li>In Early Access patch 9, Hide was a Bonus Action, but it was changed to an <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">Action</a> in the full release of the game. However, the <a href=\"/wiki/Way_of_Shadow\" title=\"Way of Shadow\">Way of Shadow</a> Monk subclass, the <a href=\"/wiki/Gloom_Stalker\" title=\"Gloom Stalker\">Gloom Stalker</a> Ranger subclass, and the <a href=\"/wiki/Rogue\" title=\"Rogue\">Rogue</a> class are still able to Hide as a <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Action</a> via class features.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cunning_Action:_Hide\" title=\"Cunning Action: Hide\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Hide_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp/25px-Hide_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Hide_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp/38px-Hide_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Hide_Bonus_Action_Icon.webp/50